# DEPRECATED — production scheduling moved to systemd (deploy/neverskip-worker/systemd/).
# Run exactly ONE scheduler. Migration:
#   1. Install + enable the timer (README "Scheduler: systemd timer").
#   2. Wait for one scheduled firing; confirm in `journalctl -u schoolpulse-neverskip-sync`
#      and `tail -n 200 /home/ubuntu/neverskip-sync.log`.
#   3. Only then remove this line with `crontab -e` and confirm `crontab -l` no longer shows it.
# run-sync.sh holds a flock, so an overlap during the migration window is skipped (exit 75), not doubled.
#
# Legacy line (remove after step 2):
# 0 */4 * * * /home/ubuntu/schoolpulse/deploy/neverskip-worker/run-sync.sh >> /home/ubuntu/neverskip-sync.log 2>&1
